msgid "Discord role IDs to mention"
msgstr "要 @ 的 Discord 身份组 ID"

#: models/config.py:98 models/config.py:191 models/config.py:217
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid "department"
msgstr "部门"

#: models/config.py:99
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid "departments"
msgstr "部门"

#: models/config.py:134
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid "A department cannot be its own parent."
msgstr "部门不能把自己设为上级部门。"

#: models/config.py:137
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid "This parent would create a loop. Pick a department above this one."
msgstr "这样设置会形成循环，请选择一个层级更高的部门。"

#: models/config.py:151
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid "colour"
msgstr "颜色"

#: models/config.py:152
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid "Higher means more urgent."
msgstr "数字越大越紧急。"

#: models/config.py:154
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid "mention roles for new tickets"
msgstr "新工单 @ 身份组"

#: models/config.py:156
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid ""
"When on, new tickets with this priority mention the department's Discord "
"roles."
msgstr "打开后，这一档的新工单会 @ 部门的 Discord 身份组。"

#: models/config.py:159
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid "remind after (minutes)"
msgstr "超时提醒（分钟）"

#: models/config.py:163
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid ""
"Mention the department again if nobody claims the ticket in time. Leave "
"empty to turn off."
msgstr "超过这个时间仍没人接手，再 @ 一次本部门。留空表示不提醒。"

#: models/config.py:166
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid "escalate after (minutes)"
msgstr "未接手多少分钟后自动申请上级介入"

#: models/config.py:170
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid ""
"Mention the parent department if nobody claims the ticket in time. Leave "
"empty to turn off."
msgstr ""
"超过这个时间仍没人接手，就自动申请上级介入（@ 上级部门）。留空表示不自动申"
"请。"

#: models/config.py:173
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid "counts as urgent"
msgstr "算作紧急"

#: models/config.py:175
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid ""
"Urgent tickets are listed first and highlighted on the overview and the "
"Alliance Auth dashboard."
msgstr "紧急工单会排在最前面，并在总览页和 AA 首页上醒目显示。"

#: models/config.py:182
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid "priority"
msgstr "紧急程度"

#: models/config.py:183
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid "priorities"
msgstr "紧急程度"

#: models/config.py:195
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid "template"
msgstr "填写模板"

#: models/config.py:195
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid "Pre-filled into the ticket text when a player picks this category."
msgstr "玩家选择这个分类后，正文框会预填这段文字。"

#: models/config.py:203
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid "category"
msgstr "分类"

#: models/config.py:204
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid "categories"
msgstr "分类"

#: models/config.py:218
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid "Leave empty to share with all departments."
msgstr "留空表示所有部门通用。"

#: models/config.py:220 models/tickets.py:12
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid "title"
msgstr "标题"

#: models/config.py:221
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid "text"
msgstr "正文"

#: models/config.py:226
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid "canned reply"
msgstr "回复模板"

#: models/config.py:227
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid "canned replies"
msgstr "回复模板"

#: models/config.py:235
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid "auto-close after (days)"
msgstr "自动关闭（天）"

#: models/config.py:238
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid ""
"Tickets waiting for the requester are closed automatically after this many "
"days without a reply."
msgstr "等待提交人回复的工单，超过这么多天没人回复就会自动关闭。"

#: models/config.py:241
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid "warn before auto-close (hours)"
msgstr "自动关闭前提醒（小时）"

#: models/config.py:243
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid ""
"The requester and the assignee are warned this many hours before a ticket "
"closes automatically."
msgstr "工单自动关闭前这么多小时，会提醒提交人和处理人。"

#: models/config.py:246
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid "requester can reopen for (days)"
msgstr "提交人可重新打开（天）"

#: models/config.py:248
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid ""
"For this many days after closing, the requester can reopen the ticket. Staff "
"can always reopen."
msgstr "工单关闭后的这么多天内，提交人可以重新打开。工作人员随时都能重新打开。"

#: models/config.py:251
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid "open tickets per person"
msgstr "每人未关闭工单上限"

#: models/config.py:254
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid ""
"A person cannot submit a new ticket while this many of their tickets are "
"still open."
msgstr "一个人的未关闭工单达到这个数量时，就不能再提交新工单。"

#: models/config.py:257
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid "new tickets per person per hour"
msgstr "每人每小时最多提交的工单数"

#: models/config.py:260
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid ""
"Limits how often one person can submit (and so ping a department). 0 means "
"no limit."
msgstr "限制一个人提交工单的频率（也就是 @ 部门的频率）。0 表示不限制。"

#: models/config.py:264
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid "maximum image size (MB)"
msgstr "图片大小上限（MB）"

#: models/config.py:267
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid "delete images after (days)"
msgstr "删除图片（天）"

#: models/config.py:270
msgctxt "aa_ticket"
msgid ""
